From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Nov 2025 16:03:28 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: Add iPXE network boot option support

[ouroBIOS: commit b581d3b8f8c8 of MrChromebox's edk2, without the files
that TianoCore's tree does not have (tools/edk2-import.py): 4 in
edk2/OuroBiosPkg (2 in a directory of TianoCore's that the package
carries whole)]

Add support for registering iPXE as a boot option when present in
the firmware volume. This allows iPXE to be included as an optional
network boot solution alongside the standard UEFI network stack.

The implementation:
- Adds PcdiPXEFile and PcdiPXEOptionName PCDs to configure the iPXE
  file GUID and boot option name
- Registers the iPXE boot option in PlatformBootManagerAfterConsole
  if the PCDs are set
- Adds NETWORK_IPXE build flag to conditionally include the iPXE
  binary in the firmware image

Signed-off-by: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
---
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dec | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dec b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dec
index eb1cb590884c98b7b93eca87ee6953916bac2dba..48d77955f6a0ce6224d358abf3478fb20284fa26 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dec
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dec
@@ -105,6 +105,10 @@ gUefiPayloadPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdPayloadFdMemSize|0|UINT32|0x10000002
 ## Save bootloader parameter
 gUefiPayloadPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdBootloaderParameter|0|UINT64|0x10000004
 
+## FFS filename to find the ipxe application.
+gUefiPayloadPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdiPXEFile|{ 0xC7, 0x53, 0x86, 0xB6, 0xA1, 0xEE, 0x35, 0x44, 0xA1, 0x99, 0xA4, 0x4F, 0x59, 0xE4, 0x47, 0x6C }|VOID*|0x10000032
+gUefiPayloadPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdiPXEOptionName|L"iPXE Network Boot"|VOID*|0x10000033
+
 ## Used to help reduce fragmentation in the EFI memory map
 gUefiPayloadPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdMemoryTypeEfiACPIReclaimMemory|0x19|UINT32|0x10000012
 gUefiPayloadPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdMemoryTypeEfiACPIMemoryNVS|0x04|UINT32|0x10000013
